          "chunk_index": 3,
          "chunk_id": "s05_c03",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s05_c3_defend_against_memorization_they_per",
          "text": "To defend against memorization, they perturb each original problem, using surface perturbations that leave the reference solution unchanged and semantic perturbations that change it, plus deliberately difficult rewrites.",
