          "chunk_id": "s05_c04",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s05_c4_finally_they_red_team_evaluation_req",
          "text": "Finally they red-team the evaluation, requiring it to reject known-wrong solutions. Every problem, solution, and metric is reviewed by at least three expert annotators.",
